<title>USA: Telephone and Data sets acquisition.</title>
<headline>Telephone and Data sets acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telephone and Data Systems Inc said Thursday it and  Township Telephone Co of Chaumont, N.Y. entered into a definitive merger agreement.</p>
<p>The transaction is subject to regulatory approvals.</p>
<p>Township serves about 6,000 telephone access lines northwest of Watertown, N.Y. Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>With the completion of this acquisition, Telephone and Data will provide service to about 490,000 access lines through 106 telephone companies in 28 states.</p>
<p>((-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
